{"4673980":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Harvestide","steam_appid":4673980,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Harvestide<\/i> is a roguelike that blends card-building with farm management. Play crop cards to plant, use spell cards to speed up growth, and construct building cards for permanent buffs—every card you play shapes your farm. But the Wither Moon descends regularly, slashing your yields, and random events can disrupt your plans at any moment. You must find your god-tier synergy before your food runs out.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4673980\/extras\/d098c113c424f34826bb3d9d307d8df2.poster.avif?t=1793720769\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4673980\/extras\/d098c113c424f34826bb3d9d307d8df2.webm?t=1793720769\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4673980\/extras\/d098c113c424f34826bb3d9d307d8df2.mp4?t=1793720769\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hundreds of Cards, Endless Combos<\/strong><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crop Cards<\/strong> – Plant them to harvest food, but they can be destroyed by the Wither Moon.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spell Cards<\/strong> – Instant effects: accelerate growth, boost yields, save your farm.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Building Cards<\/strong> – Permanent effects, but they take up precious worker slots.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4673980\/extras\/253fefb804a0c31d7c1206ce63e04235.poster.avif?t=1793720769\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4673980\/extras\/253fefb804a0c31d7c1206ce63e04235.webm?t=1793720769\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4673980\/extras\/253fefb804a0c31d7c1206ce63e04235.mp4?t=1793720769\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permanent Growth, Stronger Every Run<\/strong><br>Spend surplus food to earn coins, use them to draw cards, permanently expand your land, and raise your limits. Your farm grows along with your skills.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4673980\/extras\/e837fb1f38e5b848bedc2828bfa37093.poster.avif?t=1793720769\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4673980\/extras\/e837fb1f38e5b848bedc2828bfa37093.webm?t=1793720769\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4673980\/extras\/e837fb1f38e5b848bedc2828bfa37093.mp4?t=1793720769\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Harvestide<\/i> is a roguelike that blends card-building with farm management. Play crop cards to plant, use spell cards to speed up growth, and construct building cards for permanent buffs—every card you play shapes your farm. But the Wither Moon descends regularly, slashing your yields, and random events can disrupt your plans at any moment. You must find your god-tier synergy before your food runs out.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4673980\/extras\/d098c113c424f34826bb3d9d307d8df2.poster.avif?t=1793720769\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4673980\/extras\/d098c113c424f34826bb3d9d307d8df2.webm?t=1793720769\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4673980\/extras\/d098c113c424f34826bb3d9d307d8df2.mp4?t=1793720769\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hundreds of Cards, Endless Combos<\/strong><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crop Cards<\/strong> – Plant them to harvest food, but they can be destroyed by the Wither Moon.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spell Cards<\/strong> – Instant effects: accelerate growth, boost yields, save your farm.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Building Cards<\/strong> – Permanent effects, but they take up precious worker slots.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4673980\/extras\/253fefb804a0c31d7c1206ce63e04235.poster.avif?t=1793720769\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4673980\/extras\/253fefb804a0c31d7c1206ce63e04235.webm?t=1793720769\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4673980\/extras\/253fefb804a0c31d7c1206ce63e04235.mp4?t=1793720769\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permanent Growth, Stronger Every Run<\/strong><br>Spend surplus food to earn coins, use them to draw cards, permanently expand your land, and raise your limits. Your farm grows along with your skills.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4673980\/extras\/e837fb1f38e5b848bedc2828bfa37093.poster.avif?t=1793720769\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4673980\/extras\/e837fb1f38e5b848bedc2828bfa37093.webm?t=1793720769\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4673980\/extras\/e837fb1f38e5b848bedc2828bfa37093.mp4?t=1793720769\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","short_description":"A unique Roguelike farming game blending deckbuilding with farm management! Farm with cards, survive the Wither Moons. Build your deck, tend your farm, and reap the harvest—or starve.","supported_languages":"English, Simplified Chinese","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4673980\/9ec4c0c9e947e7c833efb465d7d0f46f8faf4eb0\/header.jpg?t=1793720769","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4673980\/8f768208bda78c02bf8cccbc490941a7bd195e5b\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793720769","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4673980\/8f768208bda78c02bf8cccbc490941a7bd195e5b\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793720769","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GTX 750 Ti<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating syst